---
import SlideLayout from '../../../layouts/SlideLayout.astro';
---
<SlideLayout
  title="Slajd 06 - O — Observe"
  bgImage="/images/background-3.jpg"
  bgOverlay="linear-gradient(rgba(10,14,23,0.80), rgba(10,14,23,0.90))"
>
  <div class="content">
    <div class="phase-badge">
      <span class="phase-letter">O</span>
      <span class="phase-name">Observe</span>
    </div>

    <h1 class="title">
      Najpierw <span class="highlight">zobacz</span> — jeszcze nie diagnozuj
    </h1>

    <p class="lede">
      Observe to <span class="lede-accent">uczciwe spojrzenie</span> na to, co dzieje się w systemie.
      Bez interpretacji, bez wniosków — same fakty.
    </p>

    <div class="columns">
      <article class="col col--tech">
        <header class="col-head">
          <div class="col-ic"><i class="ti ti-chart-line"></i></div>
          <div>
            <div class="col-eyebrow">Sygnały techniczne</div>
            <h2 class="col-title">Co mówi system</h2>
          </div>
        </header>

        <ul class="signals">
          <li><i class="ti ti-clock-hour-4"></i><span><strong>Latency</strong> — czasy odpowiedzi krytycznych ścieżek</span></li>
          <li><i class="ti ti-alert-triangle"></i><span><strong>Error rate</strong> — udział błędów w ruchu</span></li>
          <li><i class="ti ti-activity"></i><span><strong>Throughput</strong> — przepustowość żądań i zdarzeń</span></li>
          <li><i class="ti ti-flame"></i><span><strong>Liczba incydentów</strong> — częstotliwość, powtarzalność</span></li>
          <li><i class="ti ti-coins"></i><span><strong>Koszty infrastruktury</strong> — trend, nieprzewidziane wzrosty</span></li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="col col--biz">
        <header class="col-head">
          <div class="col-ic"><i class="ti ti-users"></i></div>
          <div>
            <div class="col-eyebrow">Sygnały biznesowo-organizacyjne</div>
            <h2 class="col-title">Co mówi otoczenie</h2>
          </div>
        </header>

        <ul class="signals">
          <li><i class="ti ti-message-2"></i><span><strong>Feedback zespołów</strong> — co boli przy codziennej pracy</span></li>
          <li><i class="ti ti-briefcase"></i><span><strong>Wymagania biznesowe</strong> — kierunki i priorytety</span></li>
          <li><i class="ti ti-shield-check"></i><span><strong>Compliance</strong> — regulacje, audyty, bezpieczeństwo</span></li>
          <li><i class="ti ti-world"></i><span><strong>Zmiany rynkowe</strong> — konkurencja, oczekiwania klientów</span></li>
          <li><i class="ti ti-sparkles"></i><span><strong>Nowe technologie</strong> — pojawiające się możliwości</span></li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>

    <p class="footnote">
      <i class="ti ti-alert-circle"></i>
      <span>Zbyt szybkie przejście do wniosków = decyzja na podstawie <strong>interpretacji</strong>, nie <strong>obserwacji</strong>.</span>
    </p>
  </div>
</SlideLayout>

<style is:global>
  .stage {
    justify-content: flex-start;
  }

  .content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 5;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1640px;
    padding: 70px 3rem 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .phase-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    padding: 10px 22px 10px 14px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(8, 145, 178, 0.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.45);
    margin-bottom: 22px;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease-out 0.15s forwards;
  }

  .phase-letter {
    width: 38px;
    height: 38px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--cyan-400);
    color: #0a0e17;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .phase-name {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--cyan-400);
  }

  .title {
    font-size: 70px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
    line-height: 1.06;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease-out 0.3s forwards;
  }

  .title .highlight {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--cyan-400), var(--cyan-600));
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }

  .lede {
    max-width: 1180px;
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: rgba(240, 244, 248, 0.78);
    margin-bottom: 36px;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeUp 0.9s ease-out 0.45s forwards;
  }

  .lede-accent {
    color: var(--cyan-400);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .columns {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 24px;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1420px;
    text-align: left;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }

  .col {
    padding: 26px 28px 24px;
    background: rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.55);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.18);
    border-radius: 18px;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeUp 0.9s ease-out forwards;
  }

  .col--tech {
    animation-delay: 0.6s;
    border-color: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.32);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(8, 145, 178, 0.14), rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.55));
  }

  .col--biz {
    animation-delay: 0.75s;
    border-color: rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.32);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(76, 29, 149, 0.14), rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.55));
  }

  .col-head {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 56px 1fr;
    gap: 16px;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    padding-bottom: 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.18);
  }

  .col-ic {
    width: 56px;
    height: 56px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 28px;
  }

  .col--tech .col-ic {
    background: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.14);
    border: 1px solid rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.45);
    color: var(--cyan-400);
  }

  .col--biz .col-ic {
    background: rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.14);
    border: 1px solid rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.45);
    color: #a78bfa;
  }

  .col-eyebrow {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #94a3b8;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .col--tech .col-eyebrow { color: var(--cyan-400); }
  .col--biz .col-eyebrow { color: #a78bfa; }

  .col-title {
    font-size: 26px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.3px;
    color: #f0f4f8;
    line-height: 1.15;
  }

  .signals {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .signals li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 28px 1fr;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: flex-start;
    padding: 8px 4px;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: #cbd5e1;
    font-weight: 300;
  }

  .signals li i {
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 18px;
    background: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.10);
    color: #94a3b8;
  }

  .col--tech .signals li i { color: var(--cyan-400); background: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.10); }
  .col--biz .signals li i { color: #a78bfa; background: rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.10); }

  .signals li strong {
    color: #f0f4f8;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .footnote {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    max-width: 1280px;
    padding: 14px 22px;
    background: rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.10);
    border: 1px solid rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.35);
    border-radius: 12px;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: #fef3c7;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeUp 0.9s ease-out 1s forwards;
  }

  .footnote i {
    font-size: 24px;
    color: #facc15;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .footnote strong {
    color: #fef9c3;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
</style>
